{"4712170": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Trials of the Forsaken Knight", "steam_appid": 4712170, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>The Trials of the Forsaken Knight</strong></u> is a single-player medieval fantasy dueling game built around timing, precision, and careful real-time decision-making. Battle a wide variety of deadly enemies, each with their own strengths, weaknesses, and attack patterns. Victory depends on skillful use of your abilities, well-timed parries, and striking when the moment is right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an unlikely hero, traverse a cursed kingdom and face corrupted soldiers, awakened beasts, and other dangerous foes on your quest to restore order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Master Precise Parries</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parry your opponents with precise timing. Each enemy has unique attack patterns, and adapting to their fighting style is key to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4712170/extras/c664cb09e9898372037ef1f2426118f4.poster.avif?t=1778259922\" width=1170 height=674 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4712170/extras/c664cb09e9898372037ef1f2426118f4.webm?t=1778259922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4712170/extras/c664cb09e9898372037ef1f2426118f4.mp4?t=1778259922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Unleash Powerful Attacks</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use an evolving arsenal of attacks and abilities to break through defenses, exploit weaknesses, and turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4712170/extras/f1c06df8a7107c6a63c4657f3f9d8db1.poster.avif?t=1778259922\" width=1170 height=674 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4712170/extras/f1c06df8a7107c6a63c4657f3f9d8db1.webm?t=1778259922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4712170/extras/f1c06df8a7107c6a63c4657f3f9d8db1.mp4?t=1778259922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Every Decision Matters</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mistime a parry, waste an ability, or leave yourself exposed, and the consequences can be deadly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4712170/extras/2e76062332e976d7de85da521de6a303.poster.avif?t=1778259922\" width=1170 height=674 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4712170/extras/2e76062332e976d7de85da521de6a303.webm?t=1778259922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4712170/extras/2e76062332e976d7de85da521de6a303.mp4?t=1778259922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you up to the challenge?</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>The Trials of the Forsaken Knight</strong></u> is a single-player medieval fantasy dueling game built around timing, precision, and careful real-time decision-making. Battle a wide variety of deadly enemies, each with their own strengths, weaknesses, and attack patterns. Victory depends on skillful use of your abilities, well-timed parries, and striking when the moment is right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an unlikely hero, traverse a cursed kingdom and face corrupted soldiers, awakened beasts, and other dangerous foes on your quest to restore order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Master Precise Parries</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parry your opponents with precise timing. Each enemy has unique attack patterns, and adapting to their fighting style is key to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4712170/extras/c664cb09e9898372037ef1f2426118f4.poster.avif?t=1778259922\" width=1170 height=674 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4712170/extras/c664cb09e9898372037ef1f2426118f4.webm?t=1778259922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4712170/extras/c664cb09e9898372037ef1f2426118f4.mp4?t=1778259922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Unleash Powerful Attacks</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use an evolving arsenal of attacks and abilities to break through defenses, exploit weaknesses, and turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4712170/extras/f1c06df8a7107c6a63c4657f3f9d8db1.poster.avif?t=1778259922\" width=1170 height=674 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.